[new-bypass-detail]
The exported evaluate(repo, root, invocation) function accepts root from its caller. A temporary root used the shipped invocation and profile schemas plus a profile retaining profile_id=evf.core.verification-tiers.v0-v2 and profile_version=1 while weakening V2 to minimum_provider_routes=1, independent_routes=false, negative_control_classes=[]. The invocation exactly bound the same weak profile bytes in its repository. Because _profile_current computes the canonical digest from caller_root/profile.json and the shipped profile schema does not const the exact tier requirement values, evaluation returned contract_state=satisfied and verified_tier=V2.

